# A monotonic counter covenant — STATE authored from an expression. A 4-byte counter rides in
# the covenant's own script; every spend splices it out, advances it by one, and splices it
# into the successor, so the coin carries a provable, un-forgeable hop count. It refuses any
# transition that is not exactly +1. (A guarded/bounded counter with an exit is a later rung.)
#   sci deploy examples/counter.expr count=0 hopFee=150
state count: u32
recreate(this.hopFee)
